part places
  tally 2
  note "Places of the household (story § What we had on 1 January 2021, and the accounts opened later), their owners and their openings. A holding holds one fund, its unit (L §3.2); money and units from and to the world go to the outside places world and market (L §5.10)."
  note "The joint account was opened before the run (we married 2016-09-10, story) and its statements were kept only from August 2024: it has no opening, so its balance is a hole until its first statement's reading (HOLE-ANCHOR, L §5.19)."

place ania_sav: accounts DUK lives 2025-06-02..

place deposit: claims DUK lives 2021-01-01..

place joint: accounts DUK lives 2016-09-10..

place kop_glb: holdings glb lives 2023-09-12..2024-02-29

place lazur: accounts DUK lives 2021-03-01..

place market: outside lives 2000-01-01..

place rza_cash: accounts DUK lives 2024-02-12..

place rza_glb: holdings glb lives 2024-02-12..

place rza_mm: holdings mm lives 2024-02-12..

place rzt_cash: accounts DUK lives 2021-01-01..

place rzt_div: holdings div lives 2021-01-01..

place rzt_em: holdings em lives 2021-01-01..

place rzt_glb: holdings glb lives 2021-01-01..

place rzt_idx: holdings idx lives 2021-01-01..

place wcp_a: holdings wcp lives 2021-01-01..

place wcp_t: holdings wcp lives 2021-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2000-01-01..

place wrap_bnd: wrapped bnd lives 2021-01-01..

place wrap_cash: accounts DUK lives 2021-01-01..

place wrap_glb: wrapped glb lives 2021-01-01..

place zosia_sav: accounts DUK lives 2021-01-01..

input owns[s in spouse, x in places where not x in outside]: num question "What share of this place is this spouse's?"
  note "CIV-1: what either spouse acquires during the marriage is community property, held half each (A-HR5 .1); what one got by gift or inheritance, or in exchange for it, is that spouse's alone (CIV-1 .3, A-HR5 .2)"

version openings
  cite story
  governs always
  known 2021-01-01
  note "story § What we had on 1 January 2021. The joint account has no opening (HOLE-ANCHOR until its first statement); the places opened later start empty on the day they open."
  opening[wrap_cash] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Brzask wrapped account, opened, empty"
  opening[wrap_glb] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Brzask wrapped account, opened, empty"
  opening[wrap_bnd] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Brzask wrapped account, opened, empty"
  opening[rzt_cash] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Rzeka 4471-02, opened, empty"
  opening[rzt_em] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Rzeka 4471-02, opened, empty"
  opening[rzt_idx] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Rzeka 4471-02, opened, empty"
  opening[rzt_div] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Rzeka 4471-02, opened, empty"
  opening[rzt_glb] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Rzeka 4471-02, opened, empty"
  opening[wcp_t] = 56.8312 wcp at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Nurt's plan, 56.8312 units; wek-wcp-lis-tomasz.csv line 3"
  opening[wcp_a] = 31.0457 wcp at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: Kalina's plan, 31.0457 units; wek-wcp-lis-anna.csv line 3"
  opening[deposit] = 6400.00 DUK at 2021-01-01 start "story § What we had: rent deposit, 6 400.00 DUK with the landlord (A-D30)"
  opening[zosia_sav] = 0 at 2021-01-01 start "not in the story's list of 2021-01-01: A-HR4 starts 2026-01-15"

