version ownership_ania_sav
  cite a_d37
  governs always
  known 2025-06-02
  note "the account is Ania's, and the estate payout in it is hers (CIV-1 .3); the interest it earns is community (CIV-1 .2), which a share of the place can't say: worth.tally splits the balance (A-11, awkward)"
  owns[ania, ania_sav] = 1 governs 2025-06-02.. "A-D37: holder Anna Lis"
  owns[tomek, ania_sav] = 0 governs 2025-06-02.. "A-D37: holder Anna Lis"
